    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]REGIMENTAL COMMAND - CHINOOK 91 GSO STATION[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - LV-624 AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"The following strategic objectives have been issued by Regimental Command for your current deployment to the LV-624 Area of Operations."}

    {"These objectives are to be completed in conjunction with standard mission directives and terror suppression protocol."}

    {"Deviation from these priorities must be justified through official after-action reporting."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish and maintain a secure Forward Operating Base at one of the landing sites adjacent to colonial facilities."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and recover any surviving personnel from the Nexus and adjacent colonial facilities."}
    {"[bullet]Secure and extract any classified Weston-Yamada data caches or research samples located within the colony's science wing or comms outpost."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Minimize collateral damage to the central power grid and underground water systems."}
    {"[bullet]Confirm status of remaining civilians in the Lower Colony and enact evac procedures if survivors are located."}
    {"[bullet]Conduct sweep and neutralization operations targeting the presumed terrorist presence in the Upper Colony."}

    {"Mission performance will be evaluated based on objective completion, Marine casualty rate, and command efficiency."}

    {"You are authorized to obtain additional support via requisitions uplink if deemed mission-critical."}

    {"Maintain operational discipline and report any anomalies immediately."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
