    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - LV-624 AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Your deployment to LV-624 falls under Directive C-6: Hostile Containment and Elimination."}

    {"The colony has experienced complete communications blackout following reports of biological aggression and possible corporate interference."}

    {"[underline]This is a live-combat zone.[/underline]"}

    {"Show the enemy what happens when they test the strength of the Corps."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a fortified Forward Operating Base at one of the landing sites adjacent to colonial facilities."}
    {"[bullet]Conduct lethal search-and-destroy operations within the lower colony and nearby cave systems, where unidentified hostile activity has been reported."}
    {"[bullet]Secure all Weston-Yamada assets for seizure and interrogation under Military Code 47-K."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Execute martial oversight over surviving colonists. Detain or eliminate based on security assessments."}
    {"[bullet]Deny the enemy access to comms towers and fuel processing stations."}
    {"[bullet]Clear sublevel sectors of any suspected or unidentified threats with maximum force. No survivors."}

    {"Authorization is granted for escalated rules of engagement."}
    {"[underline]No quarter. No compromise. Win fast, win completely.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
