    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - LV-624 AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"LV-624 was once a thriving example of colonial promise. Now, it has gone silent under suspicious and tragic circumstances."}

    {"Your mission is to restore order with precision and empathy."}

    {"Civilian lives may still hang in the balance."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a secure and minimally intrusive Forward Operating Base near important colonial infrastructure."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and extract any surviving colonists, researchers, or visiting personnel from the lower colony."}
    {"[bullet]Recover Weston-Yamada data carefully, ensuring no disruption to local environmental or infrastructure systems."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Preserve remaining habitats, hydroponics, and clean water systems."}
    {"[bullet]Evacuate or safeguard non-combatants from colonial dwellings and attached workplaces."}
    {"[bullet]Use nonlethal suppression methods wherever possible. Prioritize warning and deterrence over immediate force."}

    {"This operation is as much about restoration as defense."}
    {"Demonstrate the Corps' capacity for compassion and courage."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
